📖 Overview

This project is a Streamlit-based web application that analyzes the Census Income Dataset.
It provides interactive demographic insights such as age distribution, education levels, work hours, income categories, and occupations.

Users can apply filters (age, working hours, native country) to dynamically explore the dataset.
The app then displays results in the form of charts, metrics, and visualizations for better understanding.

Key technologies used:

  Pandas → Data loading and preprocessing
  
  Streamlit → Interactive dashboard & UI
  
  Matplotlib → Visualization (histograms, charts)
